-- ============================================================================
-- FC4 EXPERT DEEP SEED: Gas Processing, advanced tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: THE COLD END, THE OVERHEAD, AND WHERE THE METHOD STOPS.
-- Dew point control by expansion; marching a pressure drop rather than taking
-- one step across it; the cold separator; the still overhead nobody sells; what
-- was computed, what was chosen and what was kept; and the reading.
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. This is the only module in the package that
-- COMPUTES a Joule-Thomson coefficient. The Flow Assurance engine asks a caller
-- to type one in, and the still overhead is the only emissions figure the
-- Facilities engines produce at all. Both are taught as what the rest of the
-- platform hands to this engine and to nobody else.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. A coefficient evaluated at the inlet and
-- applied across the whole let-down is not the drop. The engine marches the
-- expansion, and the march and the one-step answer differ by an amount that
-- grows with the size of the let-down, which is exactly where a reader's
-- intuition is weakest.
--
-- SECTION 20 OF THE DIGEST IS HISTORY AND IS FRAMED AS HISTORY. Expert m05 l01
-- owns it. Before the FC4-0 repair the Joule-Thomson routine divided by a
-- compressibility the relation does not carry; the discrepancy was nothing in
-- the ideal-gas limit and grew with pressure, so it was smallest exactly where
-- a sanity check is easiest. Every prompt that touches it says it is history.
--
-- HELD FOR LITERATURE, taught as a limit and never graded in any tier: the
-- McKetta and Wehe real-gas correction, the water overhead the reboiler pays
-- for, the amine contactor's liquid density, the customary amine duty per
-- gallon, and the BTEX absorbed fraction and molecular weight. ESCRAVOS lets
-- down from BELOW the pressure the engine warns at, so neither of its two
-- graded water contents leans on the held chart correction, and its conditions
-- sit on no published case.
-- ============================================================================

